<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Data cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Data cut on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deustche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded First Data Corp to hold from accumulate on price.</p>
<p>-- First Data lost 3/4 to 39-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
